# example song for the wavetable plugin
title Wavetable demo
bpm 104; key A minor
track glass inst=wt_glass pan=-.2
pat glass.A: o5 l8 a > c e < a g b > d < g f a > c < f e g# b/4
track organ inst=wt_organ vol=.5
pat organ.A: o3 l2 [a c5 e5] [g b d5] [f a c5] [e g# b]
track growl inst=wt_growl vol=.6
pat growl.A: o2 l4 a a g g f f e e
